msgstr "These receipts have an unclear %1 sending status from an earlier run. Please check them in %1 and resolve them here -- otherwise the affected periods can never be transferred again."

#: src/jsMain/kotlin/network/lapis/cloud/client/DunningCasesScreen.kt:570
